  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since the API update last night, there is no longer a way to dynamically receive updated user biographies.\n\nThis means features such as **bio tracking** and **bio update detection** no longer work properly in VRCX and VRCNext.\n\nBoth VRCX and VRCNext are widely used tools within the VRChat community. VRCX has around **100,000 users**, while VRCNext has around **18,000 users**, with well over 100,000 unique users across both tools.\n\nThe recent WebSocket changes broke dynamic biography updates in VRCNext as well as biography logging in VRCX.\n\nThe WebSocket already provides a large amount of user information, so it is somewhat surprising that the biography is no longer included.\n\nPlease consider adding biography updates back to the WebSocket. This would allow existing features in community tools such as VRCX and VRCNext to continue working without requiring additional API requests.",
